  "rights_and_provenance": "Six SHA-locked original historical archives, five CrossWire SWORD modules using original KJV native binary verse/range indexes, HelloAO John Gill original anchors, plus one inherited, pinned JFB Genesis-hosted group introduction. Edition/source rights metadata retained in original chapter JSON. No Bible translation verse text, fabricated commentary, inferred KJV verse paths, source prose edits or geographical mappings.",
  "source_scoped_exceptions": [
    "Gill original Hosea 1-14 has exactly 197 explicit original verse anchors.",
    "Calvin original native Hosea 12:5 has no separate indexed record; 12:4 and 12:6 remain independently indexed.",
    "Matthew Henry, Clarke and JFB have original Hosea 1 book-level introductions delimited from original verse-one explanation by explicit source markers.",
    "Keil & Delitzsch first Hosea native record has an original Twelve Minor Prophets group study and Hosea-specific book preface; the original explicit Hos 1:1 exposition is separated into verse mode without discarding the rest.",
    "The accepted original JFB Prophetical Books group introduction from Genesis includes the latter prophets through Malachi and is inherited once with its original SHA and locator."
  ],
