    "Do not overwrite any accepted first 27 book snapshots, existing readers, schema, scripts or CGBC runtime.",
    "Check 103 files by exact content hashes, final Pages build and deploy, and visually inspect reader after installation.",
    "No automatic GitHub writes, player integration, workflow edits or deployment."
  ]
